WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.559 --> 00:00:16.620
gasped as the enormous dragon tried to squeeze through the portal.

2
00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:18.861
Detective Borzon trembled.

3
00:00:18.881 --> 00:00:22.261
"Is that a dragon?"

4
00:00:22.281 --> 00:00:24.602
"Yes!" Cozlin said.

5
00:00:24.622 --> 00:00:27.623
"Zark! Close the portal!"

6
00:00:28.223 --> 00:00:29.443
Zark didn't seem to hear her.

7
00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:31.764
He was staring at the dragon and shaking.

8
00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:33.972
"Close the portal!"

9
00:00:34.353 --> 00:00:35.513
Detective Borzon yelled.

10
00:00:36.353 --> 00:00:37.013
Zark blinked.

11
00:00:37.033 --> 00:00:40.394
"Sorry!" He looked at the computer controls.

12
00:00:41.254 --> 00:00:44.675
A blast of flame shot from the dragon, burning a hole in the ceiling.

13
00:00:47.876 --> 00:00:50.477
With shaking hands, Zark pressed some buttons.

14
00:00:51.177 --> 00:00:54.738
But the portal grew wide, and the dragon pushed through some more.

15
00:00:55.458 --> 00:00:56.679
Zark pressed more buttons.

16
00:00:57.379 --> 00:00:58.639
"It's no use!

17
00:00:59.119 --> 00:01:01.100
The portal won't close with the dragon in it!"

18
00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:07.182
Roar! The dragon pulled itself through.

19
00:01:08.503 --> 00:01:09.984
Its huge body filled the room.

20
00:01:10.725 --> 00:01:11.986
Everyone hid under a desk.

21
00:01:12.786 --> 00:01:16.429
Cozlin felt the room shake as computers fell to the floor and smashed.

22
00:01:17.109 --> 00:01:20.532
Then she felt an intense blast of heat, and the room grew quiet.

23
00:01:21.352 --> 00:01:22.273
Cozlin peeked out.

24
00:01:23.274 --> 00:01:24.235
The dragon was gone.

25
00:01:25.395 --> 00:01:27.337
There was an enormous hole in the building's roof.

26
00:01:28.758 --> 00:01:31.520
She flew up and spotted the dragon soaring over the city.

27
00:01:33.888 --> 00:01:35.629
Delkorians pointed and screamed.

28
00:01:35.649 --> 00:01:39.131
"It's a dragon!"

29
00:01:39.151 --> 00:01:41.032
"Run for your lives!"

30
00:01:41.932 --> 00:01:44.974
A bus zipped around a corner, and the dragon dived toward it.

31
00:01:44.994 --> 00:01:48.936
"Ahh!" The bus driver slammed on the brakes.

32
00:01:48.956 --> 00:01:50.837
"Everybody, get off!"

33
00:01:52.818 --> 00:01:55.600
Passengers jumped out of the bus as the dragon breathed fire.

34
00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:59.022
Fwoosh! The bus burst into flames.

35
00:02:00.102 --> 00:02:01.143
A passenger frowned.

36
00:02:01.163 --> 00:02:04.012
"Now I'll never get to work!"

37
00:02:04.032 --> 00:02:06.254
The dragon grabbed a car and flew off with it.

38
00:02:07.035 --> 00:02:08.556
The driver leaned out of the window.

39
00:02:08.576 --> 00:02:09.657
"Kid Comet!

40
00:02:09.977 --> 00:02:12.419
Help!" "Uh-oh!"

41
00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:14.761
Cozlin zoomed toward the dragon.

42
00:02:15.622 --> 00:02:18.064
Zap! A laser shot from her hand.

43
00:02:20.466 --> 00:02:23.409
Roar! The dragon spun around.

44
00:02:24.409 --> 00:02:26.011
The car flew out of its claws.

45
00:02:26.931 --> 00:02:27.932
The driver screamed.

46
00:02:27.952 --> 00:02:31.896
"Ahh!" Cozlin caught the car and set it down on the street.

47
00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:35.061
"Thanks, Kid Comet!"

48
00:02:35.781 --> 00:02:36.862
The driver sped away.

49
00:02:38.743 --> 00:02:41.765
Cozlin flew fast, blasting the dragon with lasers.

50
00:02:41.785 --> 00:02:45.867
"Hmph!" she thought.

51
00:02:45.887 --> 00:02:48.488
"The dragon isn't getting hurt at all."

52
00:02:49.729 --> 00:02:52.991
When she fired another one, the dragon looked back at her and growled.

53
00:02:54.292 --> 00:02:55.132
Cozlin smiled.

54
00:02:55.152 --> 00:02:57.553
"But it is getting annoyed!"

55
00:02:58.414 --> 00:02:59.234
She fired again.

56
00:03:00.095 --> 00:03:01.936
This time the dragon darted to the left.

57
00:03:02.592 --> 00:03:05.153
The laser hit a building's antenna, which broke and fell.

58
00:03:05.173 --> 00:03:09.374
"Oops!" Cozlin flew quickly, hoping to catch the antenna.

59
00:03:10.154 --> 00:03:11.735
But then she heard more screams.

60
00:03:12.355 --> 00:03:13.415
Cozlin turned to look.

61
00:03:14.175 --> 00:03:16.896
The dragon was poking its head into an office building!

62
00:03:18.236 --> 00:03:21.097
Smash! The antenna landed on a parked car.

63
00:03:21.997 --> 00:03:23.158
Someone ran out of a store.

64
00:03:23.178 --> 00:03:25.418
"My new car!"

65
00:03:26.279 --> 00:03:28.219
Cozlin felt bad about the smashed car.

66
00:03:28.979 --> 00:03:31.040
But she had to get the dragon out of that building.

67
00:03:31.624 --> 00:03:33.545
She fired lasers at the dragon's back.

68
00:03:34.326 --> 00:03:35.607
Zap! Zap!

69
00:03:36.748 --> 00:03:39.469
Roar! The dragon pulled its head out.

70
00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:41.551
Then it charged toward Cozlin.

71
00:03:41.571 --> 00:03:45.053
"Yikes!" Cozlin flew away.

72
00:03:45.874 --> 00:03:48.355
She felt flames on her feet and picked up speed.

73
00:03:48.375 --> 00:03:54.219
"Maybe I can lead the dragon away from the city," she thought.

74
00:03:57.822 --> 00:04:01.064
Cozlin flew through a bridge, zigzagging to avoid the flames.

75
00:04:02.632 --> 00:04:04.273
Suddenly she heard a snapping sound.

76
00:04:04.833 --> 00:04:06.214
She turned around and gasped.

77
00:04:07.835 --> 00:04:09.956
The dragon was caught in the bridge's cables!

78
00:04:10.857 --> 00:04:13.398
Cables snapped as the dragon tried to free itself.

79
00:04:14.118 --> 00:04:15.119
The bridge swayed.

80
00:04:15.599 --> 00:04:17.180
And then it began to collapse!

81
00:04:18.821 --> 00:04:20.742
Cars and buses rolled toward the water!

82
00:04:21.602 --> 00:04:22.463
Cozlin gulped.

83
00:04:22.483 --> 00:04:24.524
"I need help!"
